<title>UK: CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE V AUSTRALIA FINAL SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-DERBYSHIRE V AUSTRALIA FINAL SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>DERBY, England 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the third</p>
<p>and final day of the match between Derbyshire and Australia on</p>
<p>Sunday:</p>
<p>Australia first innings 362-6 declared (G.Blewett 121,</p>
<p>M.Elliott 67, M.Bevan 56)</p>
<p>Derbyshire first innings 257-9 declared (M.May 67)</p>
<p>Australia second innings (overnight 148-2)</p>
<p> M.Elliott b Harris				  4</p>
<p> M.Taylor c Krikken b Aldred		    63</p>
<p> J.Langer lbw b Dean				12</p>
<p> M.Bevan not out				   104</p>
<p> B.Julian c Jones b Dean			  62</p>
<p> S.Warne not out				     2</p>
<p> Extras (b-2 lb-4 nb-12)			  18</p>
<p>Total (for 4 wickets declared, 66 overs)  265</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-5 2-35 3-159 4-260.</p>
<p>Bowling: DeFreitas 10-3-31-0, Harris 16-3-49-1, Blackwell</p>
<p>9-1-49-0, Dean 10-0-45-2, Aldred 15-1-65-1, Rollins 2-0-12-0,</p>
<p>Clarke 4-1-8-0.</p>
<p>Derbyshire second innings</p>
<p> A.Rollins lbw b Warne			    66</p>
<p> M.May c Waugh b Julian			   27</p>
<p> C.Adams c sub b Warne			    91</p>
<p> D.Jones c Healy b Julian			 57</p>
<p> I.Blackwell c and b Warne			 5</p>
<p> V.Clarke c Julian b Warne			28</p>
<p> K.Krikken c Bevan b Warne			21</p>
<p> P.DeFreitas c sub b Warne			26</p>
<p> P.Aldred not out				   14</p>
<p> A.Harris lbw b Warne				5</p>
<p> K.Dean not out					9</p>
<p> Extras (lb-4 w-2 nb-16)			  22</p>
<p> Total (for 9 wickets, 68.3 overs)	   371</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-49 2-191 3-197 4-213 5-251 6-291 7-339</p>
<p>8-343 9-360.</p>
<p>Bowling: Gillespie 5-0-35-0, Julian 21.3-1-126-2, Waugh</p>
<p>1-0-8-0, Warne 23-2-103-7, Bevan 10-0-60-0, Elliott 8-0-35-0.</p>
<p>Result: Derbyshire won by one wicket</p>
<p>Next tour match: England v Australia, first test, June 5-9,</p>
<p>Birmingham (Edgbaston).</p>
